Id: sgid001a
Severity: ALERT
Category: filesystem
Check: check_sgid

A setgid file elsewhere on the disk has the same contents as a known
system binary. As with its setuid twin above, a copied privileged
program in an unexpected place is either a back door or a leftover.
Compare the two files, find out who put the copy there, and remove it
unless there is a documented reason for it to exist.
